              </li>
              <li id="pzh">
                <p>Dorottya Sipos</p>
                <ul>
                  <li id="aMk">
                    <p>BA student from Cognitive Science </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </li>
              <li id="1c">
                <p>You…</p>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li id="Rn">
            <p>What?</p>
            <ul>
              <li id="Bte">
                <p>Programming</p>
                <ul>
                  <li id="2ac">
                    <p>Primarily scientific computing</p>
                    <ul>
                      <li id="CVL">
                        <p>Working with structured data</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="NUW">
                        <p>Producing figures</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="4em">
                        <p>Conducting statistical analyses</p>
                      </li>
                    </ul>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </li>
              <li id="QHG">
                <p>Coding infrastructure</p>
                <ul>
                  <li id="SVR">
                    <p><a href="https://cloud.sdu.dk/app/login">UCloud</a></p>
                  </li>
                  <li id="y_o">
                    <p><span>Git (and </span><a href="https://github.com">Github</a><span>)</span></p>
                  </li>
                  <li id="aHT">
                    <p>Local (your computer)</p>
                    <ul>
                      <li id="UOj">
                        <p>Browser</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="N3m">
                        <p><span>Local Python installation, </span><a href="https://code.visualstudio.com">VSCode</a><span>, </span><a href="https://www.jetbrains.com/pycharm/">PyCharm</a><span> and other IDEs, etc.</span></p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="vfY">
                        <p>Text editor (e.g. Notepad on Window, or TextEdit on MacOS)</p>
                      </li>
                    </ul>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </li>
              <li id="2qb">
                <p>Python</p>
              </li>
              <li id="Lw_">
                <p><a href="https://jupyter.org">Jupyter notebooks</a><span> (Jupyter Lab)</span></p>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li id="t8">
            <p>Why?</p>
            <ul>
              <li id="Do2">
                <p>Do we need to learn programming?</p>
              </li>
              <li id="8I3">
                <p>This particular coding infrastructure (Jupyter on UCloud linked with GitHub)?</p>
              </li>
              <li id="KQK">
                <p><span>Are we using </span><a href="https://xkcd.com/353/">Python</a><span> and not a different programming language like </span><a href="https://www.r-project.org">R</a><span>?</span></p>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li id="8m">
            <p>How?</p>
            <ul>
              <li id="lOR">
                <p>Let’s get our UCloud setup working (We will do this together in class!!!)</p>
                <ul>
                  <li id="P5j">
                    <p>Log in to UCloud</p>
                  </li>
                  <li id="tLJ">
                    <p><span>If you haven’t already, join E26_LICS_ExperimentalPsycholinguistics workspace with </span><a href="https://cloud.sdu.dk/app/projects/invite/be9b137d-3d37-48ac-acd8-90550159f927">this link</a></p>
                  </li>
                  <li id="_fe">
                    <p>Make a folder for the course on your drive</p>
                  </li>
                  <li id="IAl">
                    <p>Start a new job</p>
                    <ul>
                      <li id="cND">
                        <p>Launch Jupyter app</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="y8f">
                        <p>Add a Job name. This is a good idea, because later you can just choose “run again” and you won’t have to do all the steps below</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="aUc">
                        <p>Add hours (enough to cover the rest of the class, or however much time you think you will need)</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="R0x">
                        <p>Select Machine type (set slider to 1)</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="8J-">
                        <p>Add the folder you made for this class (and / or any other folders you might need)</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="J2z">
                        <p>(Later we may want to add a script to Initialization, but not yet)</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="ghA">
                        <p>Click Submit and wait…</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="MWy">
                        <p>When the screen pops up to say that the job is now running, click Open interface</p>
                      </li>
                    </ul>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </li>
              <li id="CzM">
                <p>Let’s get GitHub connected (We will do this together!)</p>
                <ul>
                  <li id="Uc-">
                    <p><span>Log in to your </span><a href="https://github.com">GitHub</a><span> account</span></p>
                  </li>
                  <li id="NLJ">
                    <p>Create a public repository for this course</p>
                    <ul>
                      <li id="A4L">
                        <p>Click the link to create a readme file</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="9YF">
                        <p>Add some text</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="U0j">
                        <p>Commit</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="fzD">
                        <p>Create a personal access code (classic)</p>
                        <ul>
                          <li id="cmd">
                            <p>Profile icon</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="kn0">
                            <p>Settings</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="jsL">
                            <p>Developer settings</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="SUa">
                            <p>Personal access tokens</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="FOG">
                            <p>Tokens (classic)</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="Wuu">
                            <p>Generate new token (classic)</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="H-F">
                            <p>Click the top choice (repo)</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="7cz">
                            <p>Generate token</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="Z1f">
                            <p>Generate new token (classic)</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="Cpv">
                            <p>Give it a name in Note</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="yJ7">
                            <p>Set an expiration date (set it to March 1 2027)</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="R9d">
                            <p>Under Select scopes, select the top one (repo)</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="1YE">
                            <p>Generate token (save it, you will need it later!)</p>
                          </li>
                        </ul>
                      </li>
                    </ul>
                  </li>
                  <li id="VLc">
                    <p>Now, back in UCloud…</p>
                    <ul>
                      <li id="wD6">
                        <p>Make sure you are in the folder you made for this course</p>
                      </li>
                      <li id="qYA">
                        <p>Now we will clone our repository from GitHub</p>
                        <ul>
                          <li id="uNj">
                            <p>Git menu: Clone a repo</p>
                            <ul>
                              <li id="Ofx">
                                <p>Paste in the URL for your repo</p>
                              </li>
                              <li id="MEl">
                                <p>Include submodules</p>
                              </li>
                              <li id="JXU">
                                <p>Download the repository</p>
                              </li>
                            </ul>
                          </li>
                        </ul>
                      </li>
                      <li id="hqc">
                        <p>Now we will set our folder up to sync back to GitHub</p>
                        <ul>
                          <li id="LzG">
                            <p>Make sure you are in the repository folder</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="sN9">
                            <p>Make a change in a file from your repo</p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="aP8">
                            <p>Git menu: open repository in terminal</p>
                          </li>
                        </ul>
                      </li>
                      <li id="gK1">
                        <p>Next, we will need these terminal commands</p>
                        <ul>
                          <li id="u-D">
                            <p><code>git config --global user.name “Your Name”</code></p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="HLP">
                            <p><code>git config --global user.email you@example.com</code></p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="EwC">
                            <p><code>git config --global credential.helper store</code></p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="onB">
                            <p><code>git add -A</code></p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="xst">
                            <p><code>git commit -m "This is my very descriptive commit message"</code></p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="NvK">
                            <p><code>git push</code></p>
                          </li>
                          <li id="TX_">
                            <p><code>git pull</code></p>
                          </li>
                        </ul>
                      </li>
                    </ul>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </li>
              <li id="7_h">
                <p>Let’s make our first Jupyter notebook</p>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
